<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66930" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετασεύομαι</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετέσσῠτο</span> (v. infr.):—
			Pass.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>go with</i> or
				<i>after</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλαὶ δὲ μετεσσεύοντο γεραιαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					6.296
				</span></i>
			; <i>rush towards</i> or <i>after</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀθηναίη δὲ μετέσσυτο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					21.423
				</span></i>
			: c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετέσσυτο ποιμένα λαῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					23.389
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>rush back</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέλαγόσδε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.1270
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
